## Slutt på kodelister

### POST Sosi-file for import (legg fila i src/test/resources)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/import
#Authorization: Bearer <LEGG TIL ET BEARER-TOKEN HER, KOPIER FRA NETTLESER ETTER INNLOGGING>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Accept: application/json

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ADM_Enheter_Norge.sos"

< ./ADM_Enheter_Norge.sos
--boundary

